{"id":"613100","name":"腌绿萝卜","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/613100/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"绿萝卜","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"一块"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2骨都"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"5小勺"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"2小勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"半瓶"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"半瓶生抽，两个萝卜我放了5小勺盐，生抽也有咸味儿，不要太咸。","img":"images/613100/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"勺白糖。","img":"images/613100/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"熬半开，糖盐溶化即可。晾凉备用。","img":"images/613100/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"绿萝卜两个，切去头尾。","img":"images/613100/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切条条。","img":"images/613100/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再切成薄片。","img":"images/613100/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"切好的萝卜放容器里。","img":"images/613100/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"小米椒，姜蒜。","img":"images/613100/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"蒜切薄片。","img":"images/613100/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"姜切薄片。","img":"images/613100/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"小米椒纵切。","img":"images/613100/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"姜，蒜，小米椒放萝卜上。","img":"images/613100/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"所有食材倒入晾凉的腌料中，拌匀，淋入适量白酒。","img":"images/613100/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"稍微腌制一会儿，萝卜会腌出一部分水份。这时再装入容器。拌好即可食用。微辣鲜咸，爽脆诱人。","img":"images/613100/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/613100/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/613100/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}